{"id":"336238f06be8e591","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-lindstrom-quantifier.md","title":"Lindström Quantifier","display":"df-lindstrom-quantifier — Lindström Quantifier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-lindstrom-quantifier","aliases":["67-df-lindstrom-quantifier"],"display":"df-lindstrom-quantifier — Lindström Quantifier","depends_on":["[[67-df-syntax-interface]]","[[67-df-generalized-quantifier]]","[[67-df-isomorphism]]","[[67-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_scope":"historical-abstract-logic-material-not-located-in-this-book","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_search_scope":"provided PDF full text, contents and index; book 57 not re-audited","inherited_verification_status":"pending-source-outside-book","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-lindstrom-quantifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-lindstrom-quantifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lindstrom-quantifier — Lindström Quantifier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3f06c9fe86c236dd\" href=\"?note=3f06c9fe86c236dd\" title=\"67-df-syntax-interface\">67-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1a5df6cf30c97026\" href=\"?note=1a5df6cf30c97026\" title=\"67-df-generalized-quantifier\">67-df-generalized-quantifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aa449de50b1c012\" href=\"?note=2aa449de50b1c012\" title=\"67-df-isomorphism\">67-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bc53ba723358facc\" href=\"?note=bc53ba723358facc\" title=\"67-df-satisfaction\">67-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"historical-abstract-logic-material-not-located-in-this-book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_search_scope","html":"provided PDF full text, contents and index; book 57 not re-audited"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"pending-source-outside-book"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge1\">\\(m\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_0,\\ldots,n_{m-1}\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n_0,\\ldots,n_{m-1}\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_0,\\ldots,R_{m-1}\">\\(R_0,\\ldots,R_{m-1}\\)</span> 为互异关系符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 是下式构造的纯关系签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{Str}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{Str}_\\tau\\)</span> 为类参数，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\tau\\ ((\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K\\land\\mathfrak A\\cong_\\tau\\mathfrak B)\\Rightarrow\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathcal K)\">\\(\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\tau\\ ((\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K\\land\\mathfrak A\\cong_\\tau\\mathfrak B)\\Rightarrow\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathcal K)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为基语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_L\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathrm{Var}_L\\to|\\mathfrak M|\">\\(s:\\mathrm{Var}_L\\to|\\mathfrak M|\\)</span> 为赋值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_i\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\">\\(\\varphi_i\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x_i\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L^{n_i}\">\\(\\vec x_i\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L^{n_i}\\)</span> 且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x_i\">\\(\\vec x_i\\)</span> 各异。不同绑定表之间允许共享变量。</li>\n<li>对非空集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec B\\in\\prod_{i&lt;m}\\mathcal P(A^{n_i})\">\\(\\vec B\\in\\prod_{i&lt;m}\\mathcal P(A^{n_i})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_\\tau(A,\\vec B)\">\\(\\mathfrak A_\\tau(A,\\vec B)\\)</span> 在下式构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_i\">\\(R_i\\)</span> 始终是关系符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_i\">\\(B_i\\)</span> 是其关系解释。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_s[\\vec x:\\vec\\varphi]\">\\(\\mathfrak M_s[\\vec x:\\vec\\varphi]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_{\\mathcal K}\">\\(Q_{\\mathcal K}\\)</span> 及其绑定语义在下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[\\vec x_i\\mapsto\\vec a]\">\\(s[\\vec x_i\\mapsto\\vec a]\\)</span> 是只更新该表坐标的赋值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau&amp;\\coloneqq(\\varnothing,\\{R_i:i&lt;m\\},\\{(R_i,n_i):i&lt;m\\}),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A_\\tau(A,\\vec B)&amp;\\coloneqq(A,\\varnothing,(R_i\\mapsto B_i)_{i&lt;m}),\\\\\nQ_{\\mathcal K}^{A}(\\vec B)=1&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak A_\\tau(A,\\vec B)\\in\\mathcal K,\n&amp;Q_{\\mathcal K}^{A}(\\vec B)=0&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak A_\\tau(A,\\vec B)\\notin\\mathcal K,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M_s[\\vec x:\\vec\\varphi]&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathfrak A_\\tau\\!\\left(|\\mathfrak M|,\n\\left\\langle\\{\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak M|^{n_i}:\\mathfrak M,s[\\vec x_i\\mapsto\\vec a]\\models_L\\varphi_i\\}\\right\\rangle_{i&lt;m}\\right),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models Q_{\\mathcal K}(\\vec x_i\\,\\varphi_i)_{i&lt;m}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak M_s[\\vec x:\\vec\\varphi]\\in\\mathcal K,\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}\\!\\left(Q_{\\mathcal K}(\\vec x_i\\,\\varphi_i)_{i&lt;m}\\right)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;m}\\left(\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi_i)\\setminus\\{x_{i,j}:j&lt;n_i\\}\\right),\\\\\nQ_{\\mathcal K}&amp;\\in\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\langle n_0,\\ldots,n_{m-1}\\rangle}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau&amp;\\coloneqq(\\varnothing,\\{R_i:i&lt;m\\},\\{(R_i,n_i):i&lt;m\\}),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A_\\tau(A,\\vec B)&amp;\\coloneqq(A,\\varnothing,(R_i\\mapsto B_i)_{i&lt;m}),\\\\\nQ_{\\mathcal K}^{A}(\\vec B)=1&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak A_\\tau(A,\\vec B)\\in\\mathcal K,\n&amp;Q_{\\mathcal K}^{A}(\\vec B)=0&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak A_\\tau(A,\\vec B)\\notin\\mathcal K,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M_s[\\vec x:\\vec\\varphi]&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathfrak A_\\tau\\!\\left(|\\mathfrak M|,\n\\left\\langle\\{\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak M|^{n_i}:\\mathfrak M,s[\\vec x_i\\mapsto\\vec a]\\models_L\\varphi_i\\}\\right\\rangle_{i&lt;m}\\right),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models Q_{\\mathcal K}(\\vec x_i\\,\\varphi_i)_{i&lt;m}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak M_s[\\vec x:\\vec\\varphi]\\in\\mathcal K,\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}\\!\\left(Q_{\\mathcal K}(\\vec x_i\\,\\varphi_i)_{i&lt;m}\\right)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;m}\\left(\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi_i)\\setminus\\{x_{i,j}:j&lt;n_i\\}\\right),\\\\\nQ_{\\mathcal K}&amp;\\in\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\langle n_0,\\ldots,n_{m-1}\\rangle}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>诱导结构只具有量词类型规定的关系签名，不是含有未声明额外符号的任意“扩张”。显式保留赋值 s，使带自由参数的公式与嵌套量词都有确定语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"3f06c9fe86c236dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-generalized-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"1a5df6cf30c97026","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-generalized-quantifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2aa449de50b1c012","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"bc53ba723358facc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"m\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"n_0,\\ldots,n_{m-1}\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R_0,\\ldots,R_{m-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{Str}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\tau\\ ((\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K\\land\\mathfrak A\\cong_\\tau\\mathfrak B)\\Rightarrow\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathcal K)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_L","display":false},{"tex":"s:\\mathrm{Var}_L\\to|\\mathfrak M|","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_i\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x_i\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L^{n_i}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x_i","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec B\\in\\prod_{i<m}\\mathcal P(A^{n_i})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A_\\tau(A,\\vec B)","display":false},{"tex":"R_i","display":false},{"tex":"B_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_s[\\vec x:\\vec\\varphi]","display":false},{"tex":"Q_{\\mathcal K}","display":false},{"tex":"s[\\vec x_i\\mapsto\\vec a]","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau&\\coloneqq(\\varnothing,\\{R_i:i<m\\},\\{(R_i,n_i):i<m\\}),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A_\\tau(A,\\vec B)&\\coloneqq(A,\\varnothing,(R_i\\mapsto B_i)_{i<m}),\\\\\nQ_{\\mathcal K}^{A}(\\vec B)=1&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak A_\\tau(A,\\vec B)\\in\\mathcal K,\n&Q_{\\mathcal K}^{A}(\\vec B)=0&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak A_\\tau(A,\\vec B)\\notin\\mathcal K,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M_s[\\vec x:\\vec\\varphi]&\\coloneqq\n\\mathfrak A_\\tau\\!\\left(|\\mathfrak M|,\n\\left\\langle\\{\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak M|^{n_i}:\\mathfrak M,s[\\vec x_i\\mapsto\\vec a]\\models_L\\varphi_i\\}\\right\\rangle_{i<m}\\right),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models Q_{\\mathcal K}(\\vec x_i\\,\\varphi_i)_{i<m}&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak M_s[\\vec x:\\vec\\varphi]\\in\\mathcal K,\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}\\!\\left(Q_{\\mathcal K}(\\vec x_i\\,\\varphi_i)_{i<m}\\right)&\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{i<m}\\left(\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi_i)\\setminus\\{x_{i,j}:j<n_i\\}\\right),\\\\\nQ_{\\mathcal K}&\\in\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\langle n_0,\\ldots,n_{m-1}\\rangle}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3130,"backlinks":[{"id":"589664f33390c7ce","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$q=1$，$Q_0=Q_{\\mathcal K}$，$\\mathcal K$ 满足 [[67-df-lindstrom-quantifier]] 的类型及同构封闭条件。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-lindstrom-quantifier]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-lindstrom-quantifier]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-lindstrom-quantifier]]"}],"outgoing":["3f06c9fe86c236dd","1a5df6cf30c97026","2aa449de50b1c012","bc53ba723358facc"]}